 116           * @brief               read specified pixel of raw image
 117           * @param       addr: raw data source address
 118                                  width: the width of raw image
 119                                  xPos: the horizontal offset of raw image
 120                                  yPos: the vertical offset of raw image
 121                                  prgb: the value of the specified pixel
 122           * @retval      0: success
